      },
      "committer": {
        "name": "Mike Kinney",
        "email": "mike.kinney@gmail.com",
        "date": "2026-11-09T20:46:56Z"
      },
      "message": "feat(ui): detect pockets and slots on the Model page and create their operations\n\nThe Model page gains a \"Pockets and slots\" section: Detect lists the\nmodel's recognised features (app::recognize::pockets_of) and each row's\nCreate adds the Pocket or Slot that machines it - one CreateOperation\nthrough the command queue, its page opened, one Undo step. The plan\n(name, seed, tool-sized helix, feature mapping) moved into\napp::recognize::plan_operation and operation::seed_params so the MCP\ndetect_pockets {create} tool and the GUI create the same operation. A\ndocument change after the scan marks the list stale.\n\nPinned by pockets_tests::{detect_lists_the_slot_and_the_pocket,\ncreate_adds_each_operation_as_one_undo_step,\na_changed_document_makes_the_list_stale,\na_model_without_geometry_is_refused_by_name}.\n\nFixes #511\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
      "tree": {
        "sha": "c841aa0c5b256bb075c2e821cca00282c2ebb115",
